#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: shipping-class-restrictions.php:3
msgid "Shipping Class Restrictions"
msgstr "Shipping Class Restrictions"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: shipping-class-restrictions.php:4
msgid "https://github.com/unlocnl/shipping-class-restrictions"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: shipping-class-restrictions.php:5
msgid ""
"Restrict WooCommerce shipping method availability by the shipping classes in "
"the cart, per method instance and zone. Works with any third-party shipping "
"method."
msgstr ""
"Beperk de beschikbaarheid van WooCommerce-verzendmethoden op basis van de "
"verzendklassen in de winkelwagen, per methode-instantie en zone. Werkt met "
"elke externe verzendmethode."

#. Author of the plugin
#: shipping-class-restrictions.php:7
msgid "Unloc"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: shipping-class-restrictions.php:8
msgid "https://unloc.nl"
msgstr ""

#: src/SettingsFields.php:42
msgid "Shipping class restrictions"
msgstr "Verzendklasse beperkingen"

#: src/SettingsFields.php:44
msgid ""
"Limit when this shipping method is offered, based on the shipping classes of "
"the products in the cart. Leave it on \"No restriction\" to always offer the "
"method."
msgstr ""
"Beperk wanneer deze verzendmethode wordt aangeboden, op basis van de "
"verzendklassen van de producten in de winkelwagen. Laat op \"Geen beperking\" "
"staan om de methode altijd aan te bieden."

#: src/SettingsFields.php:48
msgid "Availability"
msgstr "Beschikbaarheid"

#: src/SettingsFields.php:50
msgid ""
"When this method is available, based on the shipping classes in the cart."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer deze methode beschikbaar is, op basis van de verzendklassen in de "
"winkelwagen."

#: src/SettingsFields.php:54
msgid "No restriction"
msgstr "Geen beperking"

#: src/SettingsFields.php:55
msgid "Show only if cart contains only these classes"
msgstr "Alleen tonen als de winkelwagen uitsluitend deze klassen bevat"

#: src/SettingsFields.php:56
msgid "Show if cart contains any of these classes"
msgstr "Tonen als de winkelwagen een van deze klassen bevat"

#: src/SettingsFields.php:57
msgid "Hide if cart contains any of these classes"
msgstr "Verbergen als de winkelwagen een van deze klassen bevat"

#: src/SettingsFields.php:58
msgid "Hide if cart contains only these classes"
msgstr "Verbergen als de winkelwagen uitsluitend deze klassen bevat"

#: src/SettingsFields.php:63
msgid "Shipping classes"
msgstr "Verzendklassen"

#: src/SettingsFields.php:68
msgid "Select shipping classes"
msgstr "Verzendklassen selecteren"

#: src/SettingsFields.php:70
msgid ""
"The shipping classes the availability rule above applies to. \"No shipping "
"class\" covers products without a class."
msgstr ""
"De verzendklassen waarop de bovenstaande beschikbaarheidsregel van "
"toepassing is. \"Geen verzendklasse\" geldt voor producten zonder klasse."

#: src/SettingsFields.php:85
msgid "No shipping class"
msgstr "Geen verzendklasse"
